<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.25;color:#0a0a0a;">
  Your order is being processed
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5ba60b;">
  Confirmed
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Great news — we have confirmed your order <strong>#{{order_number}}</strong> and our team is preparing it for fulfillment.
</p>

{{#> details}}
  {{> detail-row label="Order number" value=order_number}}
  {{> detail-row label="Status" value="Processing"}}
{{/details}}

{{#> tip title="What happens next"}}
  We will email you again when your order ships. You can track progress anytime from your Dukka orders page.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  Thanks for shopping with Dukka. If anything looks wrong, reply to this email and we will help.
</p>
